  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialogueText: {fileID: 2093365879}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1514928728}
  nameInputField: {fileID: 449804354}
  currentIndex: 0
  choicesPanel1: {fileID: 1803084399}
  choicesPanel2: {fileID: 1817392945}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1017733491}
  nameInputPanel: {fileID: 1813334056}
  backgroundAfternoonPanel: {fileID: 234953963}
  backgroundAfternoonImage: {fileID: 3497671040658348025, guid: 54a60b8720ad759458149acfffbe8846, type: 3}
  backgroundNightPanel: {fileID: 234953963}
  backgroundNightImage: {fileID: -8411839417314994153, guid: 326ed7a15a263b74eb306e6401e3c54e, type: 3}
  characterPanel: {fileID: 1063688658}
  characterIdleImage: {fileID: 459354229}
  characterHappyImage: {fileID: 1467433391}
  characterAngryImage: {fileID: 641554953}
  characterFlirtyImage: {fileID: 2015549231}
  heartMeterPanel: {fileID: 1283009980}
  heartMeterhalfImage: {fileID: 1283009978}
  heartMeter25Image: {fileID: 1730136759}
  heartMeter75Image: {fileID: 71163743}
  heartMeterfullImage: {fileID: 379773981}
  sentences:
  - Hellooo there, and who might you be
  - Name...
  - Nice to meet you, {Name}. Now aren't you a looker.
  - Cupcakes are soooo in season, wouldn't you agree?
  - 'Of course you would. That''s why you chose moi. '
  - Now tell me monsieur {Name} what's your favourite flavour?
  - VANILLA??? Oh, I didn't know that you were so...tasteless.
  - Oh, close enough...that's my cousin.
  - 'I knew you''d love Raspberries. Mmhhh, so you think I''m ravishing? '
  - Although disappointing, you are still better than that utterly stupid croissant.
  - 'Oh mon amour {Name} you are so much better than that stupid croissant. '
  - All butter and no brains.
  - '{Name}: What happened?'
  - So, do you see how strawberries and raspberries are cousins?
  - Well, let's just say that chocolate filled croissants prefer strawberries.
  - '{Name}: How horrible. How can you bare to live besides him in that display?'
  - I desipse it as much as I resent his existence.
  - But you would never do that to me would you?
  - 'Player: I would not dare to. You are too beauiful to let go of. '
  - Mmhh, is that so?
  - As long as you will always choose me then you may have all of me.
  - '{Name}: I mean, there''s always a better option.'
  - A better option?
  - A...better. better. better...better option than me?
  - You've got to be kidding me.
  - '{Name}: Oh, come on, don''t be like that. I could still eat you. You know, help
    you out of here.'
  - Ughhh, whatever.
  - '{Name}: Yeah, whatever. It''s not like you''re worth it anyways.'
